  "said": "Events\n\ndinner\n\nFriday 7, at the house. bo, through cy’s computer, hosts it.\n\nComing: bo + Maya, through cy’s computer.\n\nNobody has said they came yet.\n\nBringing someone?  Say you’re coming Say you came\nPost an event\n\nEveryone in your group — ada, bo, cy — sees it and can say they’re coming. Nobody is shown saying no.\n\nWhat:  When:  Where:  Post it to your group\n\n",
  "title": "Events"
}
