  "after": "Bring things to the table\n\nYou brought Money to house: everyone in it can open it in a few seconds. You brought Events to house: everyone in it can open it in a few seconds. You brought House rules to house: everyone in it can open it in a few seconds.\n\n Money: who paid for what, and who owes whom.\n\n Events: post a get-together, and see who’s coming.\n\n House rules: the rules your house agrees, and how you agree them.\n\nBring the ticked ones to house\n\n",
